      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Manaus. On arrival, transfer to your hotel and check in.\n\nAfter dinner, a canoe outing is scheduled for the evening to look for alligators."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:0097cdc0078a6e4a",
