      },
      "text": "Horseback riding through the green meadows around Bonito"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:ab3fd6cac362f6b0",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b92443299e337620a456e7e406ecf78abb03f476d60829dc83e6b74f77389c47",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Manaus"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3c6ede8ff18ad0e8763c32a436b0cbe3c259cd0fed61e479f4233c1a96e62ed6",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, we head out on a boat tour on the Amazon. The programme includes fishing for piranhas with a rod from the boat.\n\nNext, you’ll visit an Indigenous village and learn about the daily life, traditions and customs of the Amazon’s Indigenous people. Then take a walk through the surrounding jungle to learn about local plants and wildlife.\n\nYour guide will show you basic jungle survival skills, explain how to tell poisonous plants from edible ones and teach you how to use traditional poison-tipped arrows."
    },
